  "module_docs": [
    "Port of `net.minestom.server.network.packet.client.play.ClientClickWindowPacket`.",
    "",
    "# Local representation",
    "",
    "[`ItemStackHash`] stands in for `net.minestom.server.item.ItemStack.Hash`,",
    "which **is** ported at `crate::item::ItemStackHash` together with its",
    "`ItemStack.Hash.NETWORK_TYPE`. This file's local copy carries the full",
    "component maps (its `write_hash`/`read_hash` write the added and removed",
    "entries, not just their counts), so what is left here is dropping it for the",
    "ported type. It stays for now because this packet's public API is spelled in",
    "terms of it."
  ],
