      "byte button, ClickType clickType, Map<Short, ItemStack.Hash> changedSlots,",
      "ItemStack.Hash clickedItem) implements ClientPacket.Play`.",
      "",
      "Java freezes `changedSlots` with `Map.copyOf`, so the port keeps the entries",
